WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.458
Step 1: Open Admin → Users and choose Create user. The User setup popup tracks each step as you complete it.

2
00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:19.292
Step 2: Set up Name &amp; email, then Phone &amp; clock PIN. Add their phone number for clock/kiosk access, or choose Skip for now. The last four phone digits must be unique across the network.

3
00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:27.042
Step 3: Review Permissions, including whether they apply to this company or the network, then choose accessible Locations and a default location.

4
00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:36.667
Step 4: Choose Review invitation, check the details and press Send invitation. Only this action creates the account and sends its password setup link. Check the delivery result.

5
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:57.875
Step 5: After invitation, open Roster details. Choose employment type, classification and allowances. Check Pay Rates and Roster setup, complete missing details and Save employment details. Part-time costs need written regular hours or a current signed roster-hours IFA. Review and send selected employment documents separately. Continue when saved setup is ready for today, then Finish user setup; Skip for now leaves roster details for later.

6
00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:16.583
Step 6: Use the pencil beside a user to open their User settings popup, then choose Personal, Pay Conditions, Time &amp; Attendance or Leave &amp; Availability. Groups keep unsaved fields; Close or Escape asks before discarding them. Save account details, photos and employment terms with their own Save actions. Sign in again after access or sign-in changes.
